OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain in the
OL,6,Ffar southwest at first otherwise dry
OL,7,Fwith clear spells in the evening.
OL,8,FCloud will spread east from the late
OL,9,Fevening with rain following after
OL,10,Fmidnight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy with rain at first,
OL,13,Fthe rain clears east before midday and
OL,14,Fbright spells increase during the
OL,15,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
