OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith increasing bright spells
OL,7,FWednesday into Thursday morning. A
OL,8,Fband of cloud and rain will pass east
OL,9,FThursday afternoon then mostly dry, a
OL,10,Ffew showers Western Isles Friday.
